    "globalConstraints": "- No direct Anthropic API call and no `anthropic` SDK anywhere under `factory/`: every model call is one `query()` of `@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk`, which rides the edge-injected bearer. A file under `factory/` that imports `@anthropic-ai/sdk` or sets `x-api-key` is a blocking finding.\n- Models never run git. Every `git`, every `curl` and every kernel invocation is the boot's or the engine's own process; no worker prompt asks for one.\n- No credential is written to any file or any argv: the sandbox's bearer is injected at the edge, `CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN` is the literal `placeholder`, and the boot passes no token to the engine.\n- The `fleet/` freeze above names the old engine's own shapes \u2014 its modules, its boot and helper scripts, unit, documents and role files \u2014 and deliberately not `fleet/fleet-bootstrap.sh` (Task 2's dispatch line) nor `fleet/tests/exams/` (the driver's exam handoff stages it in every clone). The old boot path is the rollback and stays byte-identical.\n- A role file states what to produce and what to look for, never how a finding is graded: the words `blocking`, `minor`, `severity` and `verdict` do not appear in `factory/roles/exam.md` (minor).",
